   {
    "text": "Franchement, plus on découvre le cerveau, plus il ressemble à un super-héros discret.",
    "tr": {
     "en": "Honestly, the more we discover about the brain, the more it feels like a discreet superhero."
    },
    "gloss": {
     "découvre": [
      "/dekuvʀ/",
